        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3"
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]   I can't... He's too powerful. I can't afford to let him hit our squads.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "I can't... He's too powerful. I can't afford to let him hit our squads."
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"Nearl\"]   I have to intercept his attacks!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Nearl",
        "content": "I have to intercept his attacks!"
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1507_Mephisto_1#2\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2"
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]  She managed to block Faust's ballista... with only a shield--?!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "She managed to block Faust's ballista... with only a shield--?!"
    },
